<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L175" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Title" layout="Title">Perron Frobenius Theorem</Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L176" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Title" alignment="left"><Font encoding="UTF-8">Consider a 2\303\2272 </Font><Font italic="true">nonnegative</Font> matrix A=<Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation><Font encoding="UTF-8"> .Suppose the leading e-value  \316\273 \342\211\245 0  and second e-value \317\204</Font> are given, with </Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L176" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Title" alignment="left">|<Font encoding="UTF-8">\317\204| &lt; \316\273</Font> .  Since                     a+d = <Font encoding="UTF-8">\316\273+\317\204  and  ad-bc = \316\273\317\204 ,there are 2 free parameters  a  and  c  (say).  Note  (a,c)  is  the </Font>image of  (1,0) .Solving for  d  and  b  gives                                 d  =  <Font encoding="UTF-8">(\316\273 + \317\204) - a                               bc  = (a - \317\204) \303\227(\316\273 - a)It is necessary and sufficient that       a \342\210\210 [ \317\204 , \316\273 ]  in case  \317\204 \342\211\245 0 ,  and a \342\210\210 [ 0 , \316\273 -  |\317\204| ]  in case  \317\204 \342\211\244 0 .</Font>(in either case this is an interval of length  <Font encoding="UTF-8">\316\273 -  |\317\204|. ) The first restriction is necessary since  bc \342\211\245 0 .   The second is necessary since  d\342\211\2450 . </Font></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group>
<Group view="presentation" hide-input="false" hide-output="true" inline-output="false" labelreference="L176" drawlabel="true">
<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Title" alignment="left"></Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
